flowchart TD
    A[Rollback executed] --> B[Fix recovery intent and identity]
    B --> C{Rollback result completed?}
    C -->|否| X1[BLOCKED_ROLLBACK]
    C -->|是| D{Applied target matches?}
    D -->|否| X2[BLOCKED_TARGET]
    D -->|是| E[Collect recovery window]
    E --> F{Window and samples complete?}
    F -->|否| X3[BLOCKED_WINDOW]
    F -->|是| G{Metrics and checks pass?}
    G -->|否| X4[BLOCKED_RECOVERY]
    G -->|是| H{Traffic serves target?}
    H -->|否| X5[BLOCKED_TRAFFIC]
    H -->|是| I{Evidence digest bound?}
    I -->|否| X6[BLOCKED_EVIDENCE]
    I -->|是| J[RECOVERY_VERIFIED]
    J --> K[Human closes incident]
